marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up\nmessages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":11,"oldLines":6,"newStart":11,"newLines":8,"lines":[" Run it locally with `COACH_ANTHROPIC_KEY=sk-ant-... python3 bot.py 42` and type"," messages on stdin (the Telegram long-polling transport, which needs"," `COACH_TELEGRAM_TOKEN`, lives in a separate deploy repo and just calls `reply()`).","-Requires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system","-prompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up","-messages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.","+Requires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the static","+coaching instructions are their own system block with a `cache_control` marker,","+so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up messages inside the 5-minute window read","+them from cache. The athlete context (facts, date) is a second, uncached block","+after it, so a `save_fact` does not evict the instructions."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01AuvgPvqpbtNTc3LAagjbns","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
